\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces \textbf  {Universal spectral gap collapse (measured).} (a)~Sorted $\tau $ spectra of five self-trained regimes on PushT---the four preliminary arms plus the temperature-vector arm tested in Section~4; each annotation gives the largest consecutive ratio. (b)~The official LeWM world model, measured on its own released training data under the identical protocol. No spectrum contains a boundary at which a hierarchy could be cut.}}{3}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:collapse}{{1}{3}{\textbf {Universal spectral gap collapse (measured).} (a)~Sorted $\tau $ spectra of five self-trained regimes on PushT---the four preliminary arms plus the temperature-vector arm tested in Section~4; each annotation gives the largest consecutive ratio. (b)~The official LeWM world model, measured on its own released training data under the identical protocol. No spectrum contains a boundary at which a hierarchy could be cut}{figure.1}{}}
