\newlabel{fig:pseudo}{{4}{6}{\textbf {Pseudo-slow $\tau $ (measured).} (a)~Removing the entropy term yields latents that measure \emph {slower} than any healthy model. (b)~Yet the same latents decode almost nothing, and their variance is degenerate. $\tau $ without entropy is meaningless, so the free-energy form is not an analogy but the existence precondition of the metric}{figure.4}{}}
